## What the tests say

A reader must see every content photo on the six www marketing pages that show a hero photo, and on
`/products`, at 390, 980, 1024, and 1280 px, in en and th. A photo must load, show, and stay at most
30 percent covered on a 5 x 5 `document.elementFromPoint` grid, with `pointer-events:auto` forced on
every element. `/products` must show one photo in each program card and each product block, and the
Tutor section must show one. Each product picture must keep its natural aspect within 5 percent and a
short side of at least 100 px.

